  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Loom — the async video messaging platform. Maps Loom workspace users to OASIS Avatars and Loom videos to OASIS Holons. Supports video upload via the Loom two-step create-then-upload flow, paginated listing, search, and folder-based hierarchy. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
